#: ../../../developer/general/how-to-edit-the-website.rst:8
#: 262825c7439d48e2887ade9f4dba610c
msgid ""
"The Qubes OS website content is stored in the `qubesos.github.io <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS/qubesos.github.io>`__ repository and its submodules. By "
"cloning and regularly pulling from this repo, users can maintain their own "
"up-to-date offline copy of the Qubes OS website rather than relying solely "
"on the web."
