"converted from Markdown to reStructuredText and remains as a guide if you "
"want to contribute to the Qubes OS website. If you want to contribute to the "
"Qubes OS documentation, please visit :doc:`How to edit the documentation </"
"developer/general/how-to-edit-the-rst-documentation>`."
